{
  "uid": "truss-timeline",
  "title": "Truss \u2014 timeline",
  "description": "What truss reported, when. State over time for passes, gates, rotation and drift. Read the panel at the top before the panels below it.",
  "tags": [
    "truss",
    "gitops",
    "timeline"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read a timeline here",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Every band is the **state truss last reported**, held until the next pass overwrites it. Truss is a CronJob that pushes to a Pushgateway, so a band does not mean \"this was true continuously\" \u2014 it means \"this was true at the last push, and nothing has said otherwise since\".\n\n**A band that never ends is the failure mode to watch for.** If the applier stops pushing entirely, every band on this page freezes in its last healthy colour and stays there. *Since the last pass* on [Truss \u2014 applier overview](/d/truss-overview) is the only panel that goes bad on its own."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Passes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Pass outcome",
      "description": "Whether each pass reported a failure. A refusal repeats every pass until it is resolved -- the queue does not advance past a commit that failed -- so a real refusal shows as a continuous band, not a spike.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_pass_success{pass=\"frequent\"}",
          "legendFormat": "frequent pass",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_pass_success{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "daily pass",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "REFUSED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ok",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Which class of thing went wrong",
      "description": "The frequent pass. Every class is reported every pass, most of them as `clear` -- a class that appeared only when it fired would leave a query returning \"no data\" for two different facts.\n\n`digest` and `commit` are the two that mean somebody or something got past the review path. The rest are operational.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_pass_failure{pass=\"frequent\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "clear",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "FIRED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Which class of thing went wrong (daily pass)",
      "description": "The daily pass, which rotates, publishes and sweeps, and never runs the commit loop -- so `commit`, `digest` and `apply` are structurally clear here and `rotation` and `publish` can only appear here.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_pass_failure{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "clear",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "FIRED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "The rules truss re-reads every pass",
      "description": "Branch protection and rulesets are read from the forge's API on every pass and never remembered. Either going red means truss is refusing every commit -- turning protection off does not weaken the applier, it stops it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_gate_ok",
          "legendFormat": "{{gate}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "REFUSED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ok",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "State lock held elsewhere",
      "description": "Not a failure: a contended pass files nothing, leaves HEAD unmoved and sends no failure alert. The next pass is the retry. A band that never clears is a lock somebody has to break by hand.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_pass_lock_contended",
          "legendFormat": "{{pass}} pass",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "free",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "contended",
                  "color": "blue",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Secret rotation",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Rotation and publishing, day by day",
      "description": "Rotation runs on the daily pass and nowhere else. `rotation ran` meaning **no** for two consecutive days is the silent failure: nothing errored, and the 45-day clock is still running.\n\nRotation mints; the publisher writes. `rotation succeeded` yes with `publisher confirmed` no leaves the vault holding the previous value until the next daily pass republishes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_rotation_ran{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "rotation ran",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_rotation_ok{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "rotation succeeded",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_publish_attempted{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "publisher contacted",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_publish_ok{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "publisher confirmed the write",
          "refId": "D",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "alignValue": "left",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.85,
        "showValue": "never",
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "no",
                  "color": "text",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "yes",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Days until each credential expires",
      "description": "Only credentials inside the warning window or past it appear at all, so a line APPEARING is itself the event. A minted credential should never get here: it re-mints on a 45-day clock in two overlapping generations. A root credential getting here needs a human, because no API can mint it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_credential_days_left",
          "legendFormat": "{{credential}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Resource changes made by rotation",
      "description": "The rotation timeline in one number. Zero on almost every day, on purpose: the credentials plan is empty until a generation boundary is crossed, and on the day it is not, applying it IS the rotation. A spike here should be followed by `publisher confirmed the write` above.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "truss_rotation_changes{pass=\"drift\"}",
          "legendFormat": "rotation changes",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Expiry dates the publisher recorded",
      "description": "When the publisher writes a freshly minted value it records when that value dies. Zero on a day something was published is the shape that makes the expiry sweep go quiet later -- the credential exists and nothing is watching its lifetime.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
